## Claim
Text: "The United States, New Zealand, U.K., Australia, and the EU have not included the NDF in their official list of terrorist groups."
Claim author: Jonathan Malaya
Claim date: October 26, 2020

## Initial Q&A
### What does the abbreviation "NDF" stand for in the context of the claim?
Answer: In the context of the claim, "NDF" stands for the National Democratic Front of the Philippines (often abbreviated as NDFP), which is the legal political front of the Communist Party of the Philippines (CPP).

Source URL: https://verafiles.org/articles/vera-files-fact-check-badoy-errs-claiming-ndf-tagged-terror

### Did the United States include the National Democratic Front (NDF) in its official list of terrorist groups as of October 26, 2020?
Answer: Based on the provided source, the United States did not include the National Democratic Front (NDF) in its official list of terrorist groups as of October 26, 2020. The VERA Files fact-check explicitly states that "the NDFP has been declared a terrorist organization neither by the Philippine government nor by the other countries she mentioned," and clarifies that only the CPP-NPA (excluding NDFP) was listed by the U.S. and other nations.

Source URL: https://verafiles.org/articles/vera-files-fact-check-badoy-errs-claiming-ndf-tagged-terror

